  "informer":"<html><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"></head><body>\n<h2><font color=\"#993300\">\"Control Joint Position\" <i>(Component, 4 links)</i></font></h2>\n<hr>\n<font color=\"#993300\"><h3>1. link #16</h3>\nLink to Requirements Toolbox<br/>\nDocument: <font color=\"blue\">control.slreqx</font><br/>\nLocation/Item: <font color=\"blue\">#1</font><br/>\n</font>\n<h3>compute minimum jerk position traj</h3>\n\n<hr>\n<font color=\"#993300\"><h3>2. link #17</h3>\nLink to Requirements Toolbox<br/>\nDocument: <font color=\"blue\">control.slreqx</font><br/>\nLocation/Item: <font color=\"blue\">#2</font><br/>\n</font>\n<h3>Compute PID control according to position error</h3>\n\n<hr>\n<font color=\"#993300\"><h3>3. link #18</h3>\nLink to Requirements Toolbox<br/>\nDocument: <font color=\"blue\">control.slreqx</font><br/>\nLocation/Item: <font color=\"blue\">#3</font><br/>\n</font>\n<h3>Accept targets from many sources</h3>\n\n<hr>\n<font color=\"#993300\"><h3>4. link #19</h3>\nLink to Requirements Toolbox<br/>\nDocument: <font color=\"blue\">encoders_handling.slreqx</font><br/>\nLocation/Item: <font color=\"blue\">#1</font><br/>\n</font>\n<h3>Read different types of joint encoders</h3>\n\n</body></html>\n",
